1. **Enable AIGP at the BGP group level** (applies to all peers in the group):
```cli
configure router bgp
    group "GROUP_NAME"
        aigp
    exit
```

2. **Enable AIGP for a specific neighbor** (overrides group settings):
```cli
configure router bgp
    group "GROUP_NAME"
        neighbor <IP_ADDRESS>
            aigp
        exit
    exit
